msgid "The check was denied. Try again or finish with a warning."
msgstr "Se denegó la comprobación. Reintenta o finaliza con una advertencia."

#: src/ui/onboarding-assistant.c:215
msgid ""
"The check did not pass. Unlock your keyring and resume signing, then try "
"again. You can also finish with a warning."
msgstr ""
"La comprobación no se superó. Desbloquea el llavero y reanuda la firma antes "
"de reintentar. También puedes finalizar con una advertencia."

#: src/ui/onboarding-assistant.c:220
msgid ""
"No recovery phrase is available. Open Backup to save an encrypted backup "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"No hay una frase de recuperación disponible. Abre Copia de seguridad para "
"guardar una copia cifrada."

#: src/ui/onboarding-assistant.c:221
msgid ""
"The recovery phrase could not be opened. Unlock your keyring and try again."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo abrir la frase de recuperación. Desbloquea el llavero y reintenta."

#: src/ui/onboarding-assistant.c:224
msgid ""
"The identity could not be saved. Check your keyring and input, then try "
"again. Any key already saved is kept."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo guardar la identidad. Revisa el llavero y los datos y reintenta. "
"Las claves ya guardadas se conservan."

